1.1	create#refusesTwoValuesOfOneNamespace	a filing whose merged label set names two values of one namespace being refused before any gh issue create
1.2	create#refusesADoubledCitation	the filing path refusing a citation that repeats its own directory, so the item is not born stale (#189)
1.3	create#carriesTheFindingsClassAndCategory	the finding's required class and category reaching the tracker as labels (issue #201), so a finding that names its kind only in the two fields cannot file an item no selector reads
2.1	create#theAnswerShapeIsWrittenFromTheConstants	the answer's first half having one home (issue #859) — the filing path writes the decision line from this constant, so moving it moves the recorded answer
2.2	create#theAnswerShapeIsWrittenFromTheConstants	the same home for the marker half (issue #859) — the filing path binds each decision to its question with this constant, so moving it moves the comment it writes
